/*
  TourOverlay.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 shared surface · 0145 · TourOverlay (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. The keys mirror the web source
  (components/feedback/TourOverlay.tsx) one-for-one — the dialog `aria-label`, the close / skip / back
  affordances, and the Next / "Get Started!" primary action — plus the native P4 leaf chrome (loading /
  empty / error / retry) and the freshness axis (live / stale / offline) so the Swift sources hold no
  English literals. These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at
  integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table ("TourOverlay") so each parallel surface prompt
  owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.
*/

/* --- Tooltip content + controls (web `TourOverlay.tsx`) --- */
